<title>ETHIOPIA: Ethiopia's justice minister resigns.</title>
<headline>Ethiopia's justice minister resigns.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ethiopia's Justice Minister Mahetem Solomon has resigned in order to concentrate on his private businesses, officials in the prime minister's office said on Monday.</p>
<p>The officials said Prime Minister Meles Zenawi had reluctantly accepted Mahetem's resignation. His successor is yet to be named.</p>
</text>
